Defines the Command and Event types, the parser that turns a line of text
into a Command, and the Engine that maps commands to events and drives a
headless turn loop over a world.  This module imports no user interface and
calls neither ``print`` nor ``input``: a frontend parses player input into a
Command, hands it to the Engine, and renders the Events the Engine returns.
"""

<<imports>>

<<constants>>

<<functions>>

<<classes>>

<<verb registry>>
